{
  "info": {
    "name": "驾考系统 · 模拟考试模块回归测试",
    "description": "模拟考试模块回归测试（Day 17）。对应 doc/api-design.md §4.5、doc/exam-design.md。\n\n【⚠️ 跑前必须先执行「清库 SQL」】\n  DELETE FROM mock_exam_answer;\n  DELETE FROM mock_exam;\n  DELETE FROM answer_record WHERE source='EXAM';\n  DELETE FROM wrong_book WHERE user_id=(SELECT id FROM sys_user WHERE username='student01');\n（不清理会导致「重复开卷」「历史条数」等断言失败。）\n\n【★ 本集合真实写库】\n一次完整运行会新增 1 次考试记录（mock_exam）+ 10 条 answer_record(source=EXAM) + 若干错题。\n失败后要重跑，请**先再执行一次清库 SQL**。\n\n【★ 黄金标准 ③】\n本集合前 10 题「对 7 错 3」，每题 1 分 → 交卷后 score 应【恰好 = 7】。\n这是人工预知的期望值，用来证明「读库重算」真的算对（而非 mock_exam.score 与 report.score 一起错）。\n\n【★ Q6 的全角坑（有意设计，勿改）】\nquestion 表里 Q6 的标准答案存的是**全角 Ａ**；本集合组 3 对 Q6 提交的是**半角 A**。\n若判对，说明 AnswerGrader 的 NFKC 归一化生效。**这条是归一化的活体测试，改数据前请三思。**\n\n【数据基线】\n试卷 id=1（sql/seed-exam-paper.sql）：36 题 / 20 分钟 / 总分 36 / 及格 32。\n若试卷参数变化，本集合里的计数断言需同步更新。\n\n【★ 唯一真源：本文件】\n改了本 .json 后必须**重新导入 Apifox**，否则 Apifox 里跑的是旧副本。\n\n【前置】\n后端已启动；已执行 sql/seed-question.sql + seed-question-extra.sql（36 题）+ sql/seed-exam-paper.sql。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "testPassword", "value": "" },
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "paperId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "examId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "examScore", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 · 准备",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00 · 登录（拿 token）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"student01\",\n  \"password\": \"{{testPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"STUDENT\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"code = 200\", function () { pm.expect(j.code).to.eql(200); });",
                  "var token = j.data.token;",
                  "pm.test(\"拿到 token\", function () { pm.expect(token).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty; });",
                  "try { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", token); } catch (e) {}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 · 试卷列表",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "TC-EX-01 试卷列表 · 返回演示卷且参数正确",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/student/exam/papers?subjectCode=SUBJECT_1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "student", "exam", "papers"],
              "query": [{ "key": "subjectCode", "value": "SUBJECT_1" }]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"code = 200\", function () { pm.expect(j.code).to.eql(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"data 是数组\", function () { pm.expect(j.data).to.be.an(\"array\"); });",
                  "var paper = j.data[0];",
                  "pm.test(\"第一份试卷 id = 1\", function () { pm.expect(paper.id).to.eql(1); });",
                  "pm.test(\"questionCount = 36\", function () { pm.expect(paper.questionCount).to.eql(36); });",
                  "pm.test(\"totalScore = 36\", function () { pm.expect(paper.totalScore).to.eql(36); });",
                  "pm.test(\"passScore = 32\", function () { pm.expect(paper.passScore).to.eql(32); });",
                  "pm.test(\"duration = 20（分钟）\", function () { pm.expect(paper.duration).to.eql(20); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "前置：已清库、已登录。预期：1 份演示卷，参数 36 题/20 分钟/36 分/32 及格，ongoingExamId=null。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · 开始考试",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "TC-EX-02 开始考试 · 新建一场（提取 examId）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"paperId\": {{paperId}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/student/exam/start",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "student", "exam", "start"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"code = 200\", function () { pm.expect(j.code).to.eql(200); });",
                  "var d = j.data;",
                  "pm.test(\"examId 非空\", function () { pm.expect(d.examId).to.be.a(\"number\"); });",
                  "pm.test(\"status = ONGOING\", function () { pm.expect(d.status).to.eql(\"ONGOING\"); });",
                  "pm.test(\"remainingSeconds 在 1180~1200 秒之间\", function () { pm.expect(d.remainingSeconds).to.be.within(1180, 1200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"questions 长度 = 36\", function () { pm.expect(d.questions.length).to.eql(36); });",
                  "pm.test(\"题目不泄露 answer\", function () { pm.expect(d.questions[0]).to.not.have.property(\"answer\"); });",
                  "pm.test(\"已答记录为空对象\", function () { pm.expect(Object.keys(d.answeredMap || {})).to.have.lengthOf(0); });",
                  "try { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"examId\", String(d.examId)); } catch (e) {}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "前置：已清库（无进行中考试）。预期：新建一场，status=ONGOING，36 题，剩余约 1200 秒；examId 存入变量。"
        },
        {
          "name": "TC-EX-02b 试卷列表 · ongoingExamId 应指向刚开的那场（★须在交卷前执行）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/student/exam/papers?subjectCode=SUBJECT_1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "student", "exam", "papers"],
              "query": [{ "key": "subjectCode", "value": "SUBJECT_1" }]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"code = 200\", function () { pm.expect(j.code).to.eql(200); });",
                  "var examId = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"examId\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"ongoingExamId = 刚开的这场 examId\", function () { pm.expect(j.data[0].ongoingExamId).to.eql(examId); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "开考后再查试卷列表，ongoingExamId 应指向刚那场——比『清库后为 null』更稳健（不强依赖库的初始状态），也更直接地验证了该字段的功能。\n⚠️ 本用例依赖执行顺序：必须在 TC-EX-04 交卷【之前】运行（交卷后该考试已非 ONGOING，ongoingExamId 必为 null）。\n若它跑在交卷之后而失败，属于 Apifox 导入时把新用例追加到了末尾——请删除 Apifox 里的旧集合后重新导入，以恢复本文件中的顺序。"
        }
      ]
    },
